#: ../../source/reference/generated/utils/pams.utils.excess_kurtosis.rst:7
msgid "excess_kurtosis"
msgstr "excess_kurtosis"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis:1
msgid "Compute the sample excess kurtosis of a series."
msgstr "系列の標本超過尖度を計算します。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis:3
msgid ""
"The excess kurtosis is :math:`m_4 / m_2^2 - 3`, where :math:`m_j = "
"\\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{t=1}^{n} (x_t - \\bar{x})^j` is the :math:`j`-th "
"sample central moment. It is 0 for a Gaussian distribution and positive "
"for a distribution with heavier tails. This is the same estimator as the "
"default of :func:`scipy.stats.kurtosis`."
msgstr ""
"超過尖度は :math:`m_4 / m_2^2 - 3` です。ここで :math:`m_j = \\frac{1}{n} "
"\\sum_{t=1}^{n} (x_t - \\bar{x})^j` は :math:`j` "
"次の標本中心モーメントです。正規分布では0、より裾の重い分布では正の値になります。これは :func:`scipy.stats.kurtosis`"
" のデフォルトと同じ推定量です。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis:10
msgid "series, e.g. log returns."
msgstr "系列。例えば対数リターン。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis:13
msgid "excess kurtosis."
msgstr "超過尖度。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.excess_kurtosis
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

